        "explanation": "$$\\begin{gathered}\\frac{f(x-1)}{x}<0\\Leftrightarrow x>0\\text{ 且 }f(x - 1)<0\\text{，或 }x<0\\text{ 且 }f(x - 1)>0\\\\\\text{分母 }x\\ne 0\\end{gathered}$$",
        "highlight": {
          "caption": "结合分母列出符号条件",
          "connector": "⇒",
          "items": [
